msgid "For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/disk-troubleshooting.rst:97
#: 9ee5b147c4564c0d89081ddfc4bdd58d
msgid ""
"After freeing some initial space, it may be possible to recover more space "
